### Date 1: Menmi is recruited into covering a project by a coworker that will require weekend work. She goes to the office and bumps into Dev, who's also there because he enjoys the peace. Dev gets upset that menmi sacrificed her weekend to work, even though he's doing the same. Dev talks about how important it is to protect one's free time. Menmi is scared at first, but comes to understand that Dev is looking out for her.
### Date 2: The coworker who Menmi covered for takes credit for her work (seen in flashback). Menmi decides to take out her frustration by working even harder to make up for it. Dev shows up and takes Menmi out to a cafe, where they chat about standing up for herself. Menmi feels better after venting to Dev and feels comforted by him. They make a pact to not be at work the next week.
###Date 3: Menmi deliberately does NOT go to work, honoring Dev's advice to her. She goes to the park instead, where she enounters a drag performance for kids. However, one of the queens looks very familiar...